## Words we use

What the figures on our pages mean.

:::list{type="description"}

Terms

- MWp
  - Megawatt peak: what a solar system produces at most, in full sun on a cool day.
- Peak shaving
  - Covering the highest hours of a site's demand from a battery, which lowers the grid fee set by them.
  - Also called peak cutting.
- Power purchase agreement
  - A contract under which we own the system on your roof and you buy its power at a fixed price.

:::

